    "detail": "Great hotel for a short stay in Phuket. Naiyang beach isn't the best beach I would choose to go in Phuket, but it's decent and you get to enjoy the sight of the plane depart/arriving right on the beach. The room is of a decent size, bed is firm enough, although the pillow is too flat for me, the extra cushion they provide do make up for it. There are several café/food stall and a 7-11 and pharmacy nearby within walking distance. They only provide free transfer to the airport, and none from the airport. but I have no issue walking to the hotel from the airport at night.",
